ice a day, "fieros suck" im coming up with good, funny come backs.... i have not thought much about them, anyone want to come up with some? i got onei used long time ago, this is how it would go down<BR>Fieros suck<BR>at least there better than what u drive, o wait, u dont even own anything thats worth 1/4 of the vaule of it!<BR>and turn around and walk away..... any help with some others? Thanx JAson<BR>p.s. i will change my sig to IM 14,and have a pic of me and my 87 GT ttop 5 spd that is almost paid for with my own blood! (or money) ||||reg||1
